{"type":"message","id":"2eba8e98","parentId":"95e7e956","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:09.184Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 03:00 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为查事小弟，用playwright访问福建省科技厅网站 http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/，找到政策/通知公告栏目，提取以下CSS选择器：\n1. 公告列表容器选择器\n2. 单个公告条目选择器\n3. 公告标题选择器\n4. 公告跳转链接选择器\n5. 公告发布日期选择器\n返回选择器和验证结果，确保能正确提取最新省级科技政策公告。"}],"timestamp":1773428409183}}
{"type":"message","id":"aeeaf180","parentId":"2eba8e98","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:23.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在需要我作为查事小弟用playwright访问福建省科技厅网站提取CSS选择器对吧？首先我得先创建一个playwright的脚本，然后运行它来获取这些选择器。首先先写个node.js的脚本吧，用playwright去访问那个网站，然后定位到通知公告栏目，提取需要的选择器，还要验证能拿到数据。\n\n首先，先写脚本内容，然后用write工具存成fujian_kjt_scraper.js，然后运行它对吧？首先脚本里应该做的是：启动浏览器，访问http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/，然后找到政策/通知公告的板块，然后分别提取各个选择器，打印出来，还要打印取到的几条公告验证结果。\n\n那我先写这个脚本：\n首先导入playwright，然后异步函数，启动chromium，new page，goto那个网址，等待页面加载。然后先找通知公告的部分，通常这种政府网站的通知公告可能在什么类名的容器里？比如可能有\"news-list\"，\"notice-list\"，或者带\"tzgg\"的类？不对，最好是用脚本实际去查找，然后输出选择器。\n\n对，脚本里可以先找包含\"通知公告\"或者\"政策公告\"的模块，然后往下找列表容器，然后找单个条目，标题，链接，日期。\n然后写完脚本之后用exec运行node这个脚本，拿到结果。\n\n首先第一步，用write工具创建这个脚本文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f7li831n4j9qk7f2gwf0oodn","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"fujian_kjt_scraper.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  await page.goto('http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 30000 });\n\n  console.log('页面加载完成，正在查找通知公告栏目...');\n\n  // 1. 找到通知公告栏目标题\n  const noticeTitle = await page.getByText('通知公告', { exact: false }).first();\n  if (!noticeTitle) {\n    console.error('未找到通知公告栏目');\n    await browser.close();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // 2. 找到栏目对应的父容器，然后向下查找列表容器\n  const sectionContainer = await noticeTitle.locator('xpath=ancestor::div[contains(@class, \"container\") or contains(@class, \"section\") or contains(@class, \"box\")][1]');\n  const listContainer = await sectionContainer.locator('ul, div[class*=\"list\"], div[class*=\"item-wrap\"]').first();\n  \n  // 获取列表容器选择器\n  const listContainerSelector = await listContainer.evaluate(el => {\n    let selector = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n    if (el.id) selector += `#${el.id}`;\n    if (el.className) selector += `.${el.className.split(' ').filter(c => c).join('.')}`;\n    return selector;\n  });\n\n  console.log(`✅ 1. 公告列表容器选择器: ${listContainerSelector}`);\n\n  // 3. 找到单个公告条目选择器\n  const items = await listContainer.locator('li, div[class*=\"item\"], div[class*=\"news-item\"]').all();\n  if (items.length === 0) {\n    console.error('未找到公告条目');\n    await browser.close();\n    return;\n  }\n  const firstItem = items[0];\n  const itemSelector = await firstItem.evaluate(el => {\n    let selector = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n    if (el.className) selector += `.${el.className.split(' ').filter(c => c).join('.')}`;\n    return selector;\n  });\n  console.log(`✅ 2. 单个公告条目选择器: ${listContainerSelector} > ${itemSelector}`);\n\n  // 4. 公告标题选择器\n  const titleElement = await firstItem.locator('a, h3, h4, span[class*=\"title\"]').first();\n  const titleSelector = await titleElement.evaluate(el => {\n    let selector = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n    if (el.className) selector += `.${el.className.split(' ').filter(c => c).join('.')}`;\n    return selector;\n  });\n  console.log(`✅ 3. 公告标题选择器: ${itemSelector} ${titleSelector}`);\n\n  // 5. 公告跳转链接选择器\n  const linkElement = await firstItem.locator('a').first();\n  const linkSelector = await linkElement.evaluate(el => {\n    let selector = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n    if (el.className) selector += `.${el.className.split(' ').filter(c => c).join('.')}`;\n    return selector;\n  });\n  console.log(`✅ 4. 公告跳转链接选择器: ${itemSelector} ${linkSelector}`);\n\n  // 6. 公告发布日期选择器\n  const dateElement = await firstItem.locator('span[class*=\"date\"], span[class*=\"time\"], div[class*=\"date\"]').first();\n  const dateSelector = await dateElement.evaluate(el => {\n    let selector = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n    if (el.className) selector += `.${el.className.split(' ').filter(c => c).join('.')}`;\n    return selector;\n  });\n  console.log(`✅ 5. 公告发布日期选择器: ${itemSelector} ${dateSelector}`);\n\n  // 验证结果，提取前3条公告\n  console.log('\\n📋 验证结果（最新3条公告）:');\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(3, items.length); i++) {\n    const item = items[i];\n    const title = await item.locator(titleSelector).textContent();\n    const link = await item.locator(linkSelector).getAttribute('href');\n    const date = await item.locator(dateSelector).textContent();\n    \n    console.log(`${i+1}. 标题: ${title?.trim()}`);\n    console.log(`   链接: ${link?.startsWith('http') ? link : 'http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn' + link}`);\n    console.log(`   日期: ${date?.trim()}\\n`);\n  }\n\n  await browser.close();\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428409184}}
